  "thought_summary": "需要检查 is_valid_parenthesization 函数的实现，以确定其是否正确处理了未闭合左括号的情况。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "is_valid_parenthesization.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 20
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "发现 is_valid_parenthesization 函数在遍历字符串时，仅在遇到右括号时检查深度是否小于零，而未在遍历结束时检查深度是否为零，导致未闭合左括号的情况未被正确识别。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "apply_patch",
    "arguments": {
      "patch_text": "diff --git a/is_valid_parenthesization.py b/is_valid_parenthesization.py\nindex 1234567..89abcde 100644\n--- a/is_valid_parenthesization.py\n+++ b/is_valid_parenthesization.py\n@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@ def is_valid_parenthesization(parens):\n     return True\n\n    return True\n+   return depth == 0"
    }
  }
}

